  "install_text": "**SM-WU**\n\nUltrasonic level and volume meter for reservoirs and tanks.\n\n**Measured Parameters**\n- Distance (cm) — sensor to level surface\n- Level (cm) — calculated from configuration\n- Volume (L) — calculated from configuration\n- Wi-Fi Signal Strength (dBm)\n\nThe device transmits a JSON object with 5 fields. All values are sent as strings.",
